WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
The polished edge, where the light line becomes glass.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Sky and a single tree, held in the pane.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Graphite meeting graphite, with a gasket that never moves.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Terrazzo and the hard diagonal of afternoon.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.000
The doors stand open.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The opening is clear, and the floor leads straight in.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Inside, the room holds its light.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Blue hour, warm behind the glass.
